, fusion progress, and 1-hour TP projections\n\nSmart Teleports - Quick teleport to any training area with organized sections","tags":["roblox","xtel","SPTS"],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xt-el/scripts/refs/heads/main/SPTS%20legend\"))()","owner":{"_id":"68f3d8fa811805ab09badeca","username":"xt_el","verified":false,"profilePicture":"/images/photo/68f3d8fa811805ab09badeca-1760811313811.png","status":"offline","id":"68f3d8fa811805ab09badeca","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":10000}},"verified":false,"views":825,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":"/images/sb/rbx-e292fefc93522bdf51556e9c48f56626-24627da5c59b.png","likeCount":0,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-06-29T14:37:10.852Z","executes":405,"keyless":false,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"6a428316ed6678244732a287","editBy":{"_id":"68f3d8fa811805ab09badeca","username":"xt_el","status":"offline","id":"68f3d8fa811805ab09badeca"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2026-06-29T14:37:10.854Z"}],"comments":[]},{"slug":"SQUAD-UPDATE-+2X-TOKENS-SPTS:-Legends-Trainer-Nuker-Hub-229976","_id":"6a1ca68f7054e02c55a0da79","title":"Trainer Nuker Hub SPTS legend","game":{"_id":"6a1ca68f7054e02c55a0da78","gameId":140340279062020,"name":"💥[PERK! ] SPTS: Legends","imageUrl":"/images/sb/rbx-e292fefc93522bdf51556e9c48f56626-24627da5c59b.png","placeId":140340279062020},"features":"Antigravity Hub | Line Shot\nTrainer\n\nAuto-teleports to the best zone for your current stat, switches zones as you get stronger. BT has death train mode and AFK mode. Shows stat rates, next zone ETA, and fusion progress live.\nNuker\n\nFinds the best angle to hit the most enemies with one EnergySphere. Teleport or free move to shot position. Toggle each mob type on/off. Priority mode targets highest token value first. Auto-skips mobs that are too weak.\nAuto Box Opener\n\nAutomatically opens mystery boxes at up to 0.05s intervals. Toggle per tier (Tier1–4). Auto-suppresses the claim popup so it never interrupts you. Shows last drop live.\nWorld\n\nFort Lock holds your position at the fort flag. Auto Roll keeps rolling your race automatically and tracks tokens and last result.\nAuto Respawn\n\nRespawns you on death automatically. TPs you back to your training spot. Fixes camera on respawn.\nAuto Quest\n\nAuto-claims daily and weekly quest rewards.\nFusion Tracker\n\nShows TP rate, progress % and ETA to next fusion tier live.\nSettings\n\nUsername spoofer fakes your name, squad, overhead and member list every frame. Reroll fake names anytime. Anti-idle keeps you from getting kicked.\nSave System\n\nEverything saves and loads on rejoin. Manual target toggles are never overwritten by auto-skip.","tags":["autotrainer","SPTS Legends","autoquest"],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet('https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Micheal1413/Spts-legend-Script5/main/antigravity_hub_v2.lua'))()","owner":{"_id":"6a01bb89d14c55c46efbeb33","username":"ProFInalBossHacker","verified":false,"profilePicture":"/images/user-default.webp","status":"offline","id":"6a01bb89d14c55c46efbeb33","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1}},"verified":false,"discord":"https://discord.gg/invincibleshowdown","keyLink":"","views":4707,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":"/images/sb/140340279062020-1780262543823.png","likeCount":3,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-05-31T21:22:23.857Z","editBy":{"_id":"6a01bb89d14c55c46efbeb33","username":"ProFInalBossHacker","status":"offline","id":"6a01bb89d14c55c46efbeb33"},"executes":295,"keyless":false,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"6a1ca68f7054e02c55a0da7b","editBy":{"_id":"6a01bb89d14c55c46efbeb33","username":"ProFInalBossHacker","status":"offline","id":"6a01bb89d14c55c46efbeb33"},"message":"Add SPTS Legends hub: trainer, nuker, fusion tracker,